            "label": {
              "UF0506M7": "Immigrants",
              "UF0506M8": "Emigrants"
            },
            "note": {
              "UF0506M7": [
                "Level of educational attainment for immigrants refer to the year after the immigration or education completed abroad that has later been reported to Statistics Sweden. Data for the latest year will be completed the following year. Education attained abroad is self-reported while education attained in Sweden in most cases are reported by educational institutions. A change in the question about level of attainment in the annual survey of educational background for recent immigrants 2003 affects comparability with earlier years for ISCED97 level 6.",
                "In the Swedish Register of Education 2017, the annual survey “Education in a country other than Sweden” has been sent only to immigrants during the last year who don´t have information on educational attainment registered at the Swedish public employment service. The highest level of education registered at the source “Swedish public employment service” is “post-secondary education less than 3 years”."
              ],
              "UF0506M8": [
                "Level of educational attainment for emmigrants refer to programs completed not later than the year of the emigration. Data for the latest year are not complete at the first time of publishing and are therefore updated the subsequent year."
              ]
            },
